g&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ffrontpage.cba7f830.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ffrontpage.cba7f830.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ffrontpage.cba7f830.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none translate-x-[-100%] group-hover:translate-x-[100%] transition-transform duration-1000 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/15 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-foreground/5 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div></div></div><div class=\"w-2/3 md:w-full\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-4xl font-light tracking-wide mb-3\">Loic Lorente Lemoine</h1><p class=\"text-xs italic text-muted opacity-60 mb-3\">/ˈloʊ.ɪk lɔːˈrɛn.teɪ ləˈmwɑːn/</p><p class=\"text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed tracking-wide uppercase mb-6\">PhD CompSci<br><a href=\"https://www.cardiff.ac.uk/\" class=\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors duration-300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cardiff University</a></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><a href=\"https://www.cardiff.ac.uk/\" aria-label=\"Cardiff University\" title=\"Cardiff University\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Cardiff University logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-16 w-16 object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/cardiff-university.svg\"></a><a href=\"https://www.agilecps.org/\" aria-label=\"AGILE Lab\" title=\"AGILE Lab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"AGILE Lab logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-16 w-16 object-contain\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Fagilelab.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Fagilelab.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Fagilelab.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75\"></a></div><div class=\"flex gap-6 mb-6\"></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><a href=\"mailto:lorentelemoinel@cardiff.ac.uk\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-base text-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg>lorentelemoinel@cardiff.ac.uk</a><br><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/lemoineloic\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-base text-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"9\"></rect><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>linkedin.com/in/<!-- -->lemoineloic</a><br><a href=\"https://www.agilecps.org/\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-base text-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg>https://www.agilecps.org/</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"contents md:block\"><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"min-w-0 rounded border border-foreground/15 bg-background shadow-sm sticky top-16 z-30 mb-6 hidden md:block\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open page contents: Intro\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_3eatmlb_-links\" class=\"flex h-[42px] w-full min-w-0 items-center gap-2 rounded px-3 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-surface-2 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent\"><span class=\"shrink-0 text-sm\">On this page</span><span class=\"ml-auto hidden min-w-0 truncate text-xs text-muted min-[375px]:block\">Intro</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down ml-auto shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform motion-reduce:transition-none min-[375px]:ml-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><ol id=\"_R_3eatmlb_-links\" hidden=\"\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-[calc(100%+0.75rem)] max-h-[calc(100dvh-6rem-env(safe-area-inset-top)-env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] w-full overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain rounded border border-foreground/15 bg-background/70 p-1 shadow-md backdrop-blur-md md:max-h-[calc(100dvh-12rem)]\"><li class=\"min-w-0\"><a href=\"#about\" class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-sm px-3 py-2 text-base leading-relaxed transition-colors hover:bg-foreground/5 hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-accent bg-foreground/5 font-medium text-accent\" aria-current=\"location\"><span class=\"min-w-0 break-words\">Intro</span></a></li><li class=\"min-w-0\"><a href=\"#my-research-heading\" class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-sm px-3 py-2 text-base leading-relaxed transition-colors hover:bg-foreground/5 hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-accent text-foreground/80\"><span class=\"min-w-0 break-words\">My Research</span></a></li><li class=\"min-w-0\"><a href=\"#_R_3eatmlb_-0\" class=\"flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-sm px-3 py-2 text-base leading-relaxed transition-colors hover:bg-foreground/5 hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-accent text-foreground/80\"><span class=\"min-w-0 break-words\">Recent Highlights</span></a></li></ol></nav><div class=\"[&amp;_[id]]:scroll-mt-[var(--page-contents-clearance,7rem)]\" style=\"--page-contents-clearance: 60px;\"><div class=\" space-y-12\"><div class=\" space-y-12\"><section id=\"about\" data-toc-label=\"Intro\"><div class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90 [&amp;_strong]:text-accent [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:text-foreground [&amp;_a:hover]:text-muted\"><p>I'm Loic, a <strong>PhD student</strong> in the School of Computer Science and Informatics at <strong>Cardiff University</strong> + <a href=\"https://www.agilecps.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>AGILE Lab</strong></a>, under the supervision of Dr Nick Pham.</p></div></section><section id=\"my-research\" aria-labelledby=\"my-research-heading\"><h2 id=\"my-research-heading\" class=\"font-serif font-bold text-xl mb-8 tracking-wide uppercase border-b border-foreground\">My Research</h2><div class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:text-foreground [&amp;_a:hover]:text-muted\"><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:12px\">Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.</p></div><figure class=\"mt-6\"><img alt=\"Loic as a cartoon caveman being chased by a saber-toothed tiger\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto w-full rounded-xl\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 64px), (max-width: 1024px) 63vw, 635px\" srcset=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fchase.6b0fd3dd.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"><figcaption class=\"text-center text-sm text-muted mt-1 italic\">Image: Depiction of when stress helped us survive life or death situations.</figcaption></figure><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90\">Even though there is a focus on stress and seizures, the systems and methodologies presented in my work can be considered universal to other biosignal systems. I hope that the research can contribute towards healthcare companies that improve quality of life.</p></section><section id=\"recent-highlights\"><h2 class=\"font-serif font-bold text-xl mb-8 tracking-wide uppercase border-b border-foreground\" id=\"_R_3eatmlb_-0\">Recent Highlights</h2><div class=\"space-y-6 [&amp;&gt;*+*]:item-separator [&amp;&gt;*+*]:pt-6\"><div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award text-muted shrink-0\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider\">May 2026</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\"><span class=\"text-muted\"> · </span>Award</span></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-medium text-foreground mb-2\"><a href=\"https://www.sigmobile.org/mobisys/2026/asset/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-foreground transition-colors duration-300\">ASSET'26 and Mobisys Scholarship 🎓<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-300\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:text-foreground [&amp;_a:hover]:text-muted\">I have been accepted into the ASSET'26 Symposium @ ACM Mobisys 2026. Through this, I have achieved a scholarship to attend the conference in Cambridge.</p></div><div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text text-muted shrink-0\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider\">April 2026</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\"><span class=\"text-muted\"> · </span>Publication</span></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-medium text-foreground mb-2\">Workshop Paper @ Mobisys'26 📄</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:text-foreground [&amp;_a:hover]:text-muted\">My paper 'PERSE: A PERsonalised SEizure prediction system based on large-scale EEG foundation model' has been accepted to a Mobisys workshop (EIFCOM)!</p></div><div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap text-muted shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider\">April 2026</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\"><span class=\"text-muted\"> · </span>Academic</span></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-medium text-foreground mb-2\">PhD Commencement 🏁</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed mb-3 [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:text-foreground [&amp;_a:hover]:text-muted\">I have started my PhD!</p></div><div><div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trophy text-muted shrink-0\"><path